        <body>
            <div xml:id="d154">

                <pb facs="0308" n="252" sameAs="frus:frus1876/pg252"/>

                <head>No. 144.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1876-06-15"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 15,
                        1876</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fish</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>Informed by detectives Winslow discharged to-day. Brent comes before fall bench
                    Monday.</p>
                <closer><signed>HOFFMAN.</signed></closer>
            </div>
